        "detailed_description": "<strong>Termina</strong> is an intense, adrenaline-fueled, survival shooter set in a post-apocalyptic world overrun by zombies. Dive into the heart-pounding action of endless waves of the undead, scavenging for power-ups, unlocking powerful weapons, and battling through hordes of relentless zombies until your last breath.<br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>Termina is a wave-based shooter reminiscent of classic zombie survival games. Players must fend off successive waves of zombies, utilizing a variety of weapons, power-ups, and perks to survive!<br><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple weapons<br></li><li>Multiple maps to play<br></li><li>A bunch of achievements<br></li><li>perks n power-ups</li></ul>",
